  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Paul Lincoln Heffner was an American investment manager based in Hong Kong who co-founded and led Adamas Asset Management. He previously built Ajia Partners’ fund-of-funds business and worked in private wealth management at Morgan Stanley. A Columbia MBA graduate, he combined investment responsibilities with ownership of his own asset-management firm.",
